Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In the hole in the bottom of my dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,in my hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be able to find this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Any who met Giorno's mother would call\Nher a vision of unblemished beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Motherhood, however, was a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After Giorno's birth, she\Nand her son lived in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,where she left Giorno\Nat home in favor of a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,nightlife of glamour and\Nbacchanalian revelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really gonna leave\Nhim there by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he, like, two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm gonna let some kid\Ntake away my freedom, and that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless nights, Giorno\Nawoke to a vacant room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The fear and desperation that terrorized\Nhis soul must have been immeasurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy knew crying was futile,\Nso all he could do was tremble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When Giorno was four, his\Nmother married an Italian man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the marriage that would\Nmake Giorno an Italian citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why are you hiding over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Haruno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with daddy so he\Ncan take the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy's waiting for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:03:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But when his wife was away from the\Nhouse, or she wasn't paying attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always trying to skulk\Naround corners and spy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You annoying little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it, you're a depressing\Nlittle shit, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno was a constant\Nobserver of human expression,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the very man\Nwho stood before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But Giorno had also become an easy mark\Nfor the frustrated youth roaming the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's with you, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you tripping over\Nyour own feet like some klutz?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you punks, move\Nyour asses and get home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go back to your country you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Japanese freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He never even fights back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy soon saw himself\Nas the scum of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He worried it would only be a\Nmatter of time before he became
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.42,0:04:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,another crooked member of the\NNeapolitan underbelly plaguing his city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But little did Giorno\Nknow a single incident
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,was He's about to forever change his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that bastard go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab him before he slips away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't get far with those injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he have hidden someone's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you check the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be bleeding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You go straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll check out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Rigazzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen an injured\Nguy around here, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pretty tall and has black hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him go that way. Over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he won't be moving\Nvery fast in his condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear had no grip on the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thought Giorno\Nhad when he saw the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,helpless man was that he\Nwas friendless and alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In a strange turn of luck, A patch of\Nweed sprung up and obscured the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbeknownst to Giorno, it was a\Nconsequence of his golden wind ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,he had no awareness of the power and\Nactivated the ability on pure instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Two months later...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my life back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, the beatings Giorno received\Nfrom his stepfather ceased altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he care about this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit with us, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullies no longer pestered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The man was a mafioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eccoti!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, two scoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you gave me too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chocolato is my special treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe a heck of a lot to that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The man continued to watch\Nover him from a quiet distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Being an observer of human expression,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno could tell he was paying\Nhis respects not to a lowly child,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but to his fellow man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno learned a basic skill\Nfrom this silent stranger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,one his parents never\Nmanaged to teach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The ability to trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? A gunshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We should just stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Scusi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The man acted as if\NGiorno wasn't even there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,determined to keep him far away\Nfrom the grips of the Mafia world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't run off without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Little punk, screw off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your old man was trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew the rules, but he didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a drug peddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even women and children bought from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.62,0:07:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I took him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to kill this guy, but\Nthe stupid gun won't fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You called my papa trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're no better than he was!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno would never have thought to describe\Nhis silent defender with such a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In a bizarre twist of fate,\Nit was this lawbreaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,this mafioso, who guided Giorno's\Nsoul towards righteousness and virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In a city replete with corrupt politicians\Nand unscrupulous police officers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna found a reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He had no aspirations to become\Na top Zero A soccer player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He was to become a primo mafioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the distinct tang of a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Bruno Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already progressed\Nfrom questioning to torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels as if your head is about to\Nroll off your shoulders, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's understandable\Nthat you'd have no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's a zipper embedded in my skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna, make no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I could very easily roll your\Nhead all over this funicular
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,while I force the name of Leaky\NEye Luca's attacker out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If this guy gets off another attack,\NI'll be nothing but a pile of body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known about my powers for months now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is the first time\NI've ever had to seriously
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,consider using them to\Nattack another human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So far,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that a strike from Golden Wind can\Nbreathe life into any inanimate object.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever I target can be\Nturned into a living organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is going to\Nhappen if I hit an actual person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find out soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to come clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a STAN user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You could see my powers this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all adding up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You disgraced Leaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind hit him dead on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A blow that strong should have at
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,least Broken a few
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of his bones
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,did
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you just do you son of a bitch what\Nthe hell i was barely standing a second
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,ago but now my body's brimming with\Npower i can feel the energy getting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,stronger it's like some kind of life\Nstirring gasoline pulsing through my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like it's moving in slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could his stand's punch have\Nleft me in this heightened state?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A stand that supercharges your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Invigorate this, Jean Chobana!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm standing behind myself, and\Nthe handle's perfectly straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind's playing tricks on me, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I only thought I was moving with\Nsome kind of extraordinary power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if my body really has been\Nseparated from my consciousness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Miseria, I have to get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Serene pain is creeping across my jaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean isn't moving in slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My consciousness is working in hyperdrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that using golden\Nwind to flood a living person's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:12:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,body with extra life force\Nultimately leads to delirium,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,at least of the senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know why I've been\Ngranted these powers, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it would be a\Nwaste not to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm gonna call the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight won't involve\Nordinary citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the power of Giorno's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems he doesn't have a\Nclear grasp of what a stand is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes his prowess\Nall the more fearsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,These stands of ours have a limited reach,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,only a few meters from the look of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were some ordinary kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,just an unaffiliated\Nfifteen-year-old shitheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I know better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Nassaulted Leaky Eye Luca!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna know why you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss demands a straight answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it was an accident,\Nisn't what you want to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that you've found me,\Nit's my turn to be eliminated?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You came fully prepared\Nto kill, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got Executioner\Nwritten all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You boarded the car knowing that\Nyou might be ending someone's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And an Executioner must always\Nstand ready to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the bloodlust in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This little punk is\Nactually willing to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite his calm demeanor, he has a\Nsavage side, which makes him dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be this guy's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be aware that my\Nstand is the more powerful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I'm not obligated\Nto return you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm good killing you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, I believe I've had my fill of\Nexposing myself to your strange talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy this reprieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you out when\Nyou least expect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He could put a zipper on a\Nwall and pass right through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But things just got a lot\Nworse now that he's outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose track of this freak show now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it won't matter what I\Ncan do with Golden Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be able to monitor my every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing sight of him means opening\Nmyself up to be killed at any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.24,0:14:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Worst case scenario is that he tells his
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,associates that I'm the\None who did Luca in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This game of cat and mouse ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My future depends on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that zipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he use it to hide in people too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How else could he have\Ndisappeared so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been what he\Ndid with the fingers and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati's hiding in someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wearing one of them like a costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's going to\Nhead deeper into the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I should probably go grab my bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're scattering in all directions,\Nand there's not a zipper in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he hiding in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Buss off, you pesky fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I used Golden Wind to\Nimbue your broken tooth
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,with life and turned it\Ninto a common housefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fly was compelled to return to\Nyou, rendering your disguise useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for saying I wouldn't\Ninvolve ordinary citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, didn't mean to be a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't suffer any more pain\Nthan what you inflicted on that fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so it all evens out in\Nthe end. Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna, you've done very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear that your\Nabilities demand respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall face this fight head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.56,0:16:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, you forced me to\Neliminate you where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight with my life to\Nkeep you here. Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't concern myself with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think if I were in your shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd worry about what would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,after being zipped apart and\Nstrewn across the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whichever one of us lands the\Nfirst blow will end up the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vieni, vieni, Giorno Giovanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say goodbye to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I struck him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.14,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's only natural that'd\Nbe running through your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost because it's not my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, with my\Nstand's special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can conjoin objects to\Nvirtually any part of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know, this arm\Nbelongs to that goon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a quick exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Given your stand's abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can understand my wanting\Nto give myself some extra protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why your golden wind\Nwas rendered ineffective.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now. Just give up\Nalready. This is the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible he actually\Ntore off his own arm to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,lengthen his range and\Nstrike just a moment faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind do
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it damn not again
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he's forced my mind into\Nhyperdrive. Shit! I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The destructive power of Giorno\NGiovanna's stand may be negligible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but that just makes\Nthings much, much worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done it once, but to endure that\Npain in slow motion over and over...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die from the shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.08,0:19:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you step out of range?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you have a good soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the Mafia, but you're decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you went to attack\Nme, but hesitated a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:19:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized I\Nneeded to stop my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When you looked over at the\Narm you stole from this kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the abnormal marks on his\Nskin caught you off guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,which made you freeze up for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't expect to see the arm\Nof an addict, and it shocked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how old he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, an ordinary mafia\Nboss wouldn't have been impeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were that type, I'd already\Nbe ground into these stones by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're different from the other goons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I saw that, I didn't\Nsee the need in us fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Some here will even stoop\Nto selling drugs to kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've got a real big problem,\Nbecause your boss is the peddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth has you split down the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the side of the arm pains you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a chivalrous heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What does my heart have\Nto do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chivalrous or otherwise,\NI still have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My mission is to find\Nthe person who took down
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luca and execute him like\Nthe treacherous dog he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have the stomach\Nto go through with killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't expect me to show\Nthat detestable weakness! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you just don't have\Nit in you to take my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're going to be\Njoining me on my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm planning to beat your boss\Nand take back this city for the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To rid this city of drug dealing\Nand child abusing mafiosi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice but\Nto become a mafioso myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely your mission doesn't\Ninvolve joining our syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What something like that would entail?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But to take back the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to join the syndicate that\Ncontrols it and work my way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:21:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a primo mafioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The freaky you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:23:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind, I don't\Nwant to do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna freak you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I sell you?
